  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit",
    "Season the skirt steak with salt, pepper, and turmeric",
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat",
    "Sear the skirt steak for 3-4 minutes per side",
    "Transfer the skillet to the preheated oven and cook for 10-12 minutes",
    "Let the steak rest for 5 minutes before slicing it thinly",
    "In a small bowl, mix together the chopped aji amarillo pepper, garlic, ginger, and lime juice",
    "Assemble the wraps by placing a few slices of the steak onto a ssam wrap, followed by a spoonful of the pepper mixture, some pickled red onion, and a sprinkle of cilantro"
